Models:
- Raw
- Transformations
- Transformations + Augmentations

Layers/Options:
- Simple
- Regularization
- Dropout
- Regularization + Dropout

Run each model once:
  . if worst than previous result -> stop
  . if better than previous result -> run 4 more times

result == 95% Confidence Interval over the 5 runs.

